      "message": "Tested on Xiaomi Mi 10S (thyme, SM8250).\n\nVerification details:\n- **Environment**: Xiaomi SM8250 (using Qualcomm HIDL Soter HAL: `vendor.qti.hardware.soter@1.0::ISoter`).\n- **Test scope**: Both WeChat (`com.tencent.mm`) and QQ Wallet (`com.tencent.mobileqq` / Tenpay) biometric fingerprint payments were tested.\n- **Results**:\n  - ASK / AuthKey generation and certificate export completed successfully (errcode: 0).\n  - TEE signing via QSEE and Stargate FP sensor succeeded.\n  - UDFPS positioning (`getExtraParam`: `fingerprint_type` and `fingerprint_hardware_position`) is called properly with `version 2` and coordinates calculated accurately.\n  - WeChat and QQ fingerprint pay both function normally on device.\n\n**Note**: Due to hardware limitations, I only have access to Xiaomi SM8250 devices. I am unable to test Qualcomm AIDL (SM8750+), MediaTek (MiTEE / ISEE), and XRing platforms on physical devices.\n\nSanitized test log: https://gist.github.com/Flicker372/bc4bc79d2f2e44b6840f1ab78cc5fa39",
